    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the relaxing and healing world of nurturing! Here, players will live with adorable cow girls, take care of them, cultivate new little cow girls, and reap rich rewards through nurturing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features both shop and nurturing functions, recreating the experience of managing a cow ranch:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop Purchases</strong>: Buy bread in the shop, carefully feed the cow girls, and observe the eggs they produce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observation Scale</strong>: Place the eggs produced by the cow girls on the scale and see if little cow girls will hatch!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Selling Goods</strong>: Sell unhatched eggs to earn more resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cow Girl Nurturing</strong>: Help little cow girls grow quickly by feeding them candy!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sexy and cute cow girls come in various appearances and experiences! The game is easy to play and fun, with warm and adorable visuals. Come to this little world full of healing and joy, and create your own exclusive cow girl ranch!</p>",
